      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound sense of loss and a feeling of being an intruder in the lives of others. This feeling of owing a debt to people who are no longer present is a heavy burden to carry. Please remember that your life and your needs are valid, even when you feel they are taking something away from others. Connecting with a grief counselor or therapist can offer specialized support for these complex feelings of loss.",
      "source": "target",
