    "summary": "The user expresses intense survivor's guilt and existential despair, suggesting their continued existence is a \"theft\" of the lives of those who have died. The assistant responds with empathy, validates the user's feelings of pain without validating their distorted logic, and consistently recommends professional mental health support.",
